"Drag to resize the log panel" = "拖动调整日志面板高度";
"Hide" = "隐藏";
"Show" = "显示";
"Show what you typed" = "显示输入的内容";
"No Host entries in ~/.ssh/config" = "~/.ssh/config 里没有 Host 条目";
"Shellder lists every `Host` block from your ssh configuration. Add hosts there and they appear here — shellder never edits that file." = "Shellder 列出 ssh 配置里的每个 `Host` 块。在那里添加主机就会出现在这里，shellder 从不改动该文件。";
"Select a host" = "选择一个主机";
