"Settings" = "设置";
"Settings (⌘,)" = "设置 (⌘,)";
"config error: %@" = "配置错误：%@";
"resolving…" = "解析中…";
"Connect: one attempt. If it succeeds the master stays up until it drops or you switch it off. If it fails the switch goes back off. Jump hosts from this list are switched on with it, and switching a jump host off takes the hosts behind it down." = "连接：只尝试一次。成功后 master 会一直保持，直到断开或你关掉开关。失败则开关自动弹回。列表里的跳板主机会随之打开，关掉跳板主机会连带关闭经由它的主机。";

