/* Tools */
"Tools" = "工具";
"%@: needs the host connected" = "%@：需要先连接主机";
"Lock" = "锁定";
"Unlock" = "解锁";
"Locked: shellder reconnects this host after a drop and switches it on again when it starts. Switching it off, or a failed attempt, unlocks it." = "已锁定：断开后 shellder 会重连此主机，并在启动时再次打开它。关掉开关或一次失败的尝试都会解锁。";
"Lock: switch the host on if it is off, then keep it connected. A drop is reconnected with back-off and the host comes back at the next launch. The lock goes with the switch: off, or a failed attempt, unlocks it." = "锁定：主机若未打开则打开，然后保持连接。断开后按退避重连，下次启动时自动恢复。锁定跟随开关：关闭或一次失败的尝试都会解锁。";
"Disconnect" = "断开";
"Disconnect: same as switching off. Closes the master and unlocks it." = "断开：等同于关掉开关。关闭 master 并解锁。";
"Disconnect: same as switching off. Closes the master, unlocks it, and switches off the hosts that jump through it (%@)" = "断开：等同于关掉开关。关闭 master 并解锁，同时关闭经由它跳转的主机 (%@)";
"Reconnect" = "重新连接";
"Reconnect: close the master and connect again. The switch and the lock stay as they are." = "重新连接：关闭 master 再连一次。开关和锁保持不变。";
"Take over" = "接管";
"Take over: close the external master and start one owned by shellder. Switches the host on." = "接管：关闭外部 master，启动一个由 shellder 管理的。会打开主机开关。";
"Retry now" = "立即重试";
"Retry now: try again immediately instead of waiting for the back-off" = "立即重试：不等退避时间，马上再试一次";
"Connect" = "连接";
"Connect: same as the switch, one attempt, kept up if it succeeds" = "连接：与开关相同，只尝试一次，成功后保持";
"Close socket" = "关闭 socket";
"Close socket: ssh -O exit, shuts the master down and removes %@. The switch goes off and the lock with it, and hosts jumping through this one go down as well." = "关闭 socket：执行 ssh -O exit，关闭 master 并删除 %@。开关随之关闭，锁也解除，经由此主机跳转的主机同样断开。";
"the socket" = "socket";
"Keep-alive" = "保活";
"Keep-alive mode" = "保活方式";
"Keep-alive mode: -N is cleanest. Servers that close session-less connections get an idle login shell, then cat. shellder escalates by itself and remembers the result." = "保活方式：-N 最干净。会关闭无会话连接的服务器改用空闲登录 shell，再不行用 cat。shellder 会自动升级并记住结果。";
"no session (-N)" = "无会话 (-N)";
"idle shell (pty)" = "空闲 shell (pty)";
"cat on stdin" = "stdin 上的 cat";
"Shell: run `%@` in the application that handles ssh:// links (Terminal unless you chose another). Goes through the master, so no prompts." = "Shell：在处理 ssh:// 链接的应用里运行 `%@`（未另选时为“终端”）。经由 master，不会有提示。";
"Copy files" = "拷贝文件";
"Copy files: an upload to %@ is still running" = "拷贝文件：到 %@ 的上传还在进行";
"Copy files: pick files and folders, then scp them into the home directory on %@ through the master. Failures show in an alert, everything else in the log." = "拷贝文件：选择文件和文件夹，经由 master 用 scp 拷到 %@ 的主目录。失败会弹窗，其余记录在日志。";
"Copy the selected files and folders to the home directory on %@" = "把所选文件和文件夹拷贝到 %@ 的主目录";
"scp exited with status %lld. See the log for details." = "scp 以状态 %lld 退出。详见日志。";
"%@: copy failed" = "%@：拷贝失败";

